          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būsugi bo ng'wa Toola",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyabīta ī likanza lya ng'wa Abimeleki, ūbūūka ngosha wa kūbapīja a Baisilaeli, wa kūfuma mu lūganda lwa ng'wa Isakaali, lina lyakwe Toola ng'witūnja o ng'wa Pua ng'wana Dodo. Ū wei walī azengile Shamili, mu sī ya magūlya ya Efulaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngosha ng'wenūyo akabatongeela a Baisilaeli ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī n'idatū, hūna ūcha, ūjīkwa mu Shamili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būsugi bo ng'wa Yaili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenūyo ūlondeelwa na Yaili wa Gileadi; nang'hwe ūbatongeela a Baisilaeli ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī n'ībīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walī na bitūnja makūmi adatū, baalī na ndamhī ja nzobe makūmi adatū. A bitūnja benabo ū mu Gileadi baalī basugile mizengo makūmi adatū, īyo kūshisha lelo ītaalī īkwitanagwa Havoti-yaili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Havoti-yaili:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ng'hambī ja ng'wa Yaili.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yaili aho waacha ūjīkwa mu nzengo gwa Kamoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhūbi wa Baisilaeli na kūlīla kwabo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bīīta hangī yabūbi ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; bandya kūgatūmamīla Maabaalī na Maashitoleti, na baamulungu ba Alaamu, baamulungu ba Sidoni, baamulungu ba Moabu, baamulungu ba Baamoni, na baamulungu ba Bafilisiti. Na lūūlū īkī a Baisilaeli bakang'wīība ū SEEBA, booya ū kūntūmamīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabapelanīla no. Ūbajinja mu makono ga Bafilisiti na Baamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'waka ngwenūyo būbaponda ponda na kūbakenaagūla kībi no. Yūbīta myaka ikūmi n'īnaane bakūbaluhyaga pye a Baisilaeli ba kū ntambūko gwa kīya ya mongo gwa Yolodani, ū kū sī ya Gileadi; ī ya Baamooli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baamoni nabo būyūgūkīla ū mongo gwa Yolodani kwiza kwilwisha būlūgū na a banhū ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Yuda, na a ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Benjamini, na a ba ng'wa Efulaimu; a Baisilaeli būbiza mu makoye madito no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a Baisilaeli būnīlīīla ū SEEBA balīhaya, “Twakūhūbile nguno twanekile ū Mulungu wise twandya kūgatūmamīla Maabaalī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūbashokeja alīhaya, “A Bamisili, na a Baamooli, na a Baamoni, na a Bafilisiti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na a Basidoni, na a Baamaleki, pye na a Bamoabu aho baamukoyaga no no no, nose ng'ūnilīlīīla gīkī namugunaane, natamupīgije ū mu makono gabo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha ng'wanilekile ng'wandya kūtūmamīla baamulungu bangī; na lūūlū natūshokeela hangī kūmuguna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaagi mukabalīlīīle a baamulungu abo ng'wabasola, a benabo hū bene bakūmupīja ūlū mulī mu makoye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a Baisilaeli būnshokeja ū SEEBA gīkī, “Twahūbile; twītīlage mhayo gose gose ūyo ūlīgūbona gīkī gūlī gwawiza. Gwike tūlīkwikūmbīlīja ī haha ūtūpīje.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna būgīnja a maamulungu ga nyageni ayo baalī nago, bandya kūntūmamīla SEEBA. Umulungu ūdūūma kwiyūmīlīja kūwiloleela ū būluhi wa Baisilaeli wa būligwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baamoni aho bihela kwamba būlūgū, būtūūl'ī ng'hambī yabo mu Gileadi; a Baisilaeli nabo bikuminga, a bene būtūūla ī ng'hambī yabo Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batongeeji ba bana Gileadi būyilūnja lūnja boi bike balīhaya, “Nani akwandya ū kūlwa na a Baamoni? Ū ng'wenūyo akūbiza ntongeeji wa bana Gileadi bose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
